{"chunk_id": "47bd1a0d-c1b6-4366-8fe4-ef18f4f138aa", "doc_id": "xhs_006_product_manager_offtopic", "text": "这篇不是技术岗，是产品实习，但因为标题里也有腾讯/一面/面经，所以关键词抓取可能会抓到。\n\n- 自我介绍\n- 为什么想做产品经理\n- 你常用哪些 AI 产品\n- 分析一个你觉得体验不好的功能\n- 如果让你设计一个校园二手交易功能，你怎么做需求拆解\n- 如何判断一个功能上线后有没有效果\n- 说一个你做过的数据分析项目\n- 怎么和研发沟通需求变更", "chunker_name": "semantic", "source_type": "xiaohongshu", "level": 0, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "semantic_topic", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "腾讯产品实习一面面经", "metadata": {"topic": "project", "semantic_mode": "lexical", "n_blocks": 2}, "char_len": 172}
{"chunk_id": "3f0a5037-7b91-4e74-88a4-f228a5eef0e7", "doc_id": "xhs_006_product_manager_offtopic", "text": "面试官很温柔，主要看逻辑和表达。完全没有问 MySQL、Redis、JVM、算法。对后端 RAG 知识库来说，这篇应该被识别为低相关或者单独隔离。", "chunker_name": "semantic", "source_type": "xiaohongshu", "level": 0, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "semantic_topic", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "腾讯产品实习一面面经 > 个人感受", "metadata": {"topic": "redis", "semantic_mode": "lexical", "n_blocks": 1}, "char_len": 73}
